      {
        "id": 2060263378,
        "content": "@0x4007 It seems the `CLAIMABLE_URL` is not populated in the env anymore? I am pretty sure I tried it but it was within the same repo so it is possible that it doesn't work for external pull requests, will have a look at it.\r\nAfter investigation, two main issues: \r\n- one is that we can hit the rate limit as the requests are not made with a logged in account, see [here](https://github.com/ubiquity/pay.ubq.fi/actions/runs/8673501893/job/23784918609#step:6:119)\r\n- two is that `secrets.UBIQUIBOT_PRIVATE_KEY` is not populated due to the nature of it being a Pull Request event, so the ERC20 generation [fails](https://github.com/ubiquity/pay.ubq.fi/actions/runs/8715600893/job/23907762866#step:5:68) thus no URL is generated",
